serviceTelemetryLogLines = carriedTable "service-telemetry/log-lines.json" (Object (KM.fromList [("$comment", String "AUTHORITY for the lines a service writes to its log, and for the supervisor's line it reads. THE LOGGER of a service whose document names a LogFormat writes one line to stdout for each thing it logs at or above its LogLevel. A `json` line is one JSON object: its `first` members, the level's name in lower case and the message; then the fields the line was logged with; then `requestId`, the request's id (gateway/response-headers.json's `requestId`), on a line logged while a request was answered; then the active trace's id and span's id in lower-case hex, 32 and 16 digits, on a line logged inside one; and `last`, the moment in UTC as RFC 3339 with milliseconds. A `simple` line is `simple`, with `{timestamp}` the moment in UTC as `YYYY-MM-DD hh:mm:ss`, `{LEVEL}` the level's name in upper case, and then, when the line has any fields, a space and the JSON object of them, `requestId` and the trace's among them. THE BUS LOG (EVENT-BUS.md \xa7\& Wire format: the bus log), switched on by XYNOLOG_BUS_LOG, writes one line for each frame its process sends or receives: `line`, with `{op}` one of `ops` and `{channel}` the frame's channel, or `content` for an upload or a read of bytes; then each of `parts` there is one of, with the first `characters` of it; then a space and the payload, as bus/log-cases.json says it is shown. THE SUPERVISOR writes `line` each time it starts the service, with `{time}` the moment in UTC as `YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ssZ`, `{name}` SUPERVISE_NAME and `{count}` the rapid failures so far, to the file SUPERVISE_EVENTS names; a service counts each line of that file that holds `counted` as one of its lives."), ("bus", Object (KM.fromList [("line", String "[bus {op}] {channel}"), ("ops", Array (V.fromList [String "EMIT", String "RECV", String "SSE", String "PUT", String "GET"])), ("parts", Array (V.fromList [Object (KM.fromList [("part", String "the frame's scope"), ("text", String " scope={scope}")]), Object (KM.fromList [("characters", Number (read "8.0")), ("part", String "the frame's correlationId"), ("text", String " cid={correlationId}")]), Object (KM.fromList [("characters", Number (read "8.0")), ("part", String "the active trace's id"), ("text", String " trace={traceId}")])]))])), ("logger", Object (KM.fromList [("json", Object (KM.fromList [("first", Array (V.fromList [String "level", String "message"])), ("last", String "timestamp"), ("requestId", String "requestId"), ("trace", Array (V.fromList [String "trace_id", String "span_id"]))])), ("services", Array (V.fromList [String "archivist", String "dispatcher", String "gateway"])), ("simple", String "{timestamp} [{LEVEL}] {message}")])), ("supervisor", Object (KM.fromList [("counted", String "starting {name}"), ("line", String "[supervise {time}] starting {name} (rapid failures so far: {count})")]))]))

